<title>USA: Reno Air names Fisher as interim CFO.</title>
<headline>Reno Air names Fisher as interim CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reno Air Inc said Thursday it had named Jeffrey Todd Fisher, former vice president of planning and corporate development, as its interim chief financial officer and vice president of finance.</p>
<p>Fisher succeeds Paul Tate, who was named chief financial officer at United Express carrier Atlantic Coast Airlines.</p>
